# ${SRC_DIR}/

Application code for ${PROJECT_NAME}. Stamped on ${TIMESTAMP}.

## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| [`config/`](config/) | Env loader (zod-validated via `expo-constants`), `QueryClient` singleton. |
| [`navigation/`](navigation/) | React Navigation stack/tab routing — `RootNavigator` + param-list types. |
| [`screens/`](screens/) | One folder per screen. Strict 4-subfolder rule (see [`screens/README.md`](screens/README.md)). |
| [`features/`](features/) | Cross-screen domain features (auth, profile, etc.). Same 4-subfolder rule. |
| [`components/`](components/) | Reusable presentational components — base UI, no screen wiring. |
| [`hooks/`](hooks/) | Shared cross-screen hooks. |
| [`lib/`](lib/) | Framework-agnostic primitives. No imports from `screens/`, `navigation/`, or `api/`. |
| [`api/`](api/) | API client surface — fetch wrappers, endpoint typings. |
| [`types/`](types/) | Shared type declarations. |
| [`tests/`](tests/) | Unit tests + fixtures. |

The top-level `App.tsx` lives at the repo root (Expo convention) and only
composes `SafeAreaProvider` + `QueryClientProvider` + `NavigationContainer`.

## Naming convention

Content must be inferable from the suffix:

- `*.tsx` — React components and screens.
- `use*.ts` — hooks.
- `*.service.ts` — business-logic helpers (API orchestration, transforms).
- `*.types.ts` — types local to a folder.
- `*.test.tsx` / `*.spec.ts` — tests.

## File size

Soft cap: **300–500 lines**. Run `npm run lint:size` to surface offenders.
Warning-only by default.

